Kreisverkehr.TsDecoder
Copyright 2017-2023 Cinegy GmbH for the original Cinegy.TsDecoder work.

This package is an unofficial fork of Cinegy.TsDecoder. Changes by Kreisverkehr
include support for current-multiplex EIT schedule tables, scheduled-table
change notifications, transport-stream timestamp and duration conversions,
tests for EIT schedule decoding, and EIT parsing fixes for pointer fields,
section assembly, and descriptor loop boundaries. These changes are licensed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The original work and this fork are
distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0; see the accompanying
LICENSE file.